QSEECOM APP_START 被 TZ 拒绝时, qcom_scm_remap_error 只识别 6 个已知
负码, 其余一律落入默认分支映射成 -EINVAL, 上层无法区分
EINVAL_ARG(-2)/EINVAL_ADDR(-3) 与其它未知码. 本机加载 fingerpr TA 正
落在此情况: dev_dbg 只有 remap 后的 -22 和 a1=-1, a0 原值丢失, 无法
判断 TZ 拒的是地址还是参数.

在 __scm_smc_call 返回前补打原始 a0-a3, 并连同本次调用的
owner/svc/cmd/arginfo/args 一并输出. 仅诊断用途, 定位后移除.
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c
index 5749307..83b1adf 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c
@@ -210,6 +210,14 @@ int __scm_smc_call(struct device *dev, const struct qcom_scm_desc *desc,
 		res->result[2] = smc_res.a3;
 	}
 
-	return (long)smc_res.a0 ? qcom_scm_remap_error(smc_res.a0) : 0;
+	if (smc_res.a0) {
+		dev_warn(dev,
+			 "scm: raw smc result a0=%ld a1=%ld a2=%ld a3=%ld (owner=%x svc=%x cmd=%x arginfo=%x args=%llx %llx %llx)\n",
+			 (long)smc_res.a0, (long)smc_res.a1, (long)smc_res.a2,
+			 (long)smc_res.a3, desc->owner, desc->svc, desc->cmd,
+			 desc->arginfo, desc->args[0], desc->args[1], desc->args[2]);
+		return qcom_scm_remap_error(smc_res.a0);
+	}
 
+	return 0;
 }
